WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:03.860
Vikram, a police constable
recently posted to the village,

2
00:03.900 --> 00:07.500
is desperately trying to find his way out.

3
00:08.100 --> 00:12.140
It is in this twisted dimension
that he encounters Vetal,

4
00:12.400 --> 00:15.500
a devious spirit from Hindu mythology,

5
00:15.940 --> 00:18.400
and they form a pact for survival

6
00:18.600 --> 00:21.900
as Vikram cannot endure the Atman dimension

7
00:22.260 --> 00:25.400
and Vetal cannot exist in our world.
